1. Current-source AC-4 reproduction — capture window 2026-11-15 14:13:11.581561–14:18:18.055618 UTC. The executed r2.3 health-check selected 6,050 matched cereal/VisionIPC frames over 302.471744064 s and 6,049 EOF intervals. Mean cadence was 19.998562241636 fps (<20.0 required); maximum EOF gap was 90.981562 ms (>60 ms required), with 716/6,049 intervals over 60 ms. Thus AC-4 fails both the mean and max-gap thresholds. Frame IDs were contiguous, timestamp/validity comparisons had zero mismatches, source input hashes did not drift, runtime publication and cleanup passed, the sidecamerad process exited 0, its FFmpeg child was reaped, and no listeners remained. Startup all-false Params remains unverified; front-left=true before shutdown and all-false after shutdown were observed. Source: `../build/evidence/runtime-smoke-ac4-r2.3.log` SHA-256 74722d2c6d4ca799f92529c2bce256cf7c6531ecaccbf2d8071d3139c7df19b; per-frame series: `../build/artifacts/runtime_cadence_intervals-r2.3.json` SHA-256 626f0881c22814e055d724ce8683c5206d5c3090dd507e582327362202f53696; typed executed probe: `../build/artifacts/runtime_probe-ac4-r2.3.json` SHA-256 e018216e41f7f94f0684e45b21f84ca441cfacf2a954a51888ce1def8610cb35; report: `../build/reports/report_runtime_health-ac4-r2.3.md` SHA-256 2118c1a3a04ab3ca82d8fa1ef38fdd82855537520c528f5a0801d5aa1c3ae8d2. The product source hash recorded by the probe, `system/sidecamerad.py` SHA-256 494fb8b88fda8bcf1d8301225019f4f01f4b77a0bb5cb3e69dde47ed96e1309b, matches the current file.

